---
description: Test and verification bar for any change
globs: ["**/*.test.*", "**/*.spec.*", "**/tests/**", "**/__tests__/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing rules

- A new behaviour gets a test that fails without the change.
- Assert what the user sees or what the contract promises — not internal calls, not CSS classes.
- No snapshot of a whole page; snapshot the small piece whose change you want to notice.
- Never `.skip`, never `--no-verify`, never a loosened assertion to get green.
- A bug fix starts with the test that reproduces the bug.
- Web: vitest. Python: pytest. Contract: against the OpenAPI file.
